{"id":143,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"This glutton appears in villages without warning and devours the entirety of their rice granaries—such occurrences have long been counted among the gravest of disasters."},{"games":["Shield","Crystal"],"text":"This Pokémon’s stomach is so strong, even eating moldy or rotten food will not affect it."},{"games":["Sword","X","FireRed"],"text":"It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Will eat anything, even if the food happens to be a little moldy. It never gets an upset stomach."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It has no interest in anything other than eating. Even if you climb up on its stomach while it’s napping, it doesn’t seem to mind at all!"},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It doesn’t do anything other than eat and sleep. When prompted to make a serious effort, though, it apparently displays awesome power."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It eats nearly 900 pounds of food every day. It starts nodding off while eating—and continues to eat even while it’s asleep."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its stomach is said to be incomparably strong. Even Muk’s poison is nothing more than a hint of spice on Snorlax’s tongue."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Snorlax’s typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile Pokémon that there are children who use its expansive belly as a place to play."},{"games":["Y","Diamond"],"text":"Its stomach can digest any kind of food, even if it happens to be moldy or rotten."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"When its belly is full, it becomes too lethargic to even lift a finger, so it is safe to bounce on its belly."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Its stomach’s digestive juices can dissolve any kind of poison. It can even eat things off the ground."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"What sounds like its cry may actually be its snores or the rumblings of its hungry belly."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"It stops eating only to sleep. It doesn’t feel full unless it eats nearly 900 pounds a day."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Immunity","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's immune system prevents it from being poisoned."},{"name":"Thick Fat","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is protected by a layer of thick fat, which halves the damage taken from Fire- and Ice-type moves."},{"name":"Gluttony","hidden":true,"description":"If the Pokémon is holding a Berry to be eaten when its HP is low, it will instead eat the Berry when its HP drops to half or less."}],"eggGroups":["Monster"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"mountain","color":"Black","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":446,"name":"Munchlax","condition":null,"children":[{"id":143,"name":"Snorlax","condition":"Level up, High Friendship","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,103],[1,111],[1,118],[1,122],[1,175],[1,254],[1,256],[1,278],[1,335],[1,343],[1,374],[1,387],[12,281],[16,44],[20,156],[20,173],[20,214],[24,242],[28,34],[32,484],[36,133],[40,667],[44,359],[48,187],[52,562],[56,416]],"machine":[133,59,776,34,280,523,204,886,242,174,91,38,89,227,203,263,126,7,53,374,411,264,416,441,912,535,484,270,667,63,304,58,8,196,442,118,189,200,182,240,156,157,317,201,402,247,214,479,76,707,164,241,916,57,36,851,87,9,85,885,253,528,428],"egg":[562,68,174,38,90],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me55-119","name":"Snorlax","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"119","artist":"Aya Kusube","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-119/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-119/large"},{"id":"me3-63","name":"Snorlax","set":"Perfect Order","date":"2026-03-27","rarity":"Common","number":"63","artist":null,"small":"https://